yara-x, BSD-3-Clause (source derivative)
----------------------------------------

Parts of the YARA engine are derived from yara-x's source:
src/yara/base64.rs, src/yara/matcher.rs (base64 verification) and
src/yara/modules/ (mod, pe, elf, dotnet, math, hash, string, time). The tests
tests/yara_conformance.rs, tests/yara_difftest.rs and
tests/yara_coverage_difftest.rs adapt yara-x's own. Each of these files carries
an attribution header. The license is also in LICENSE-YARA-X.

